<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1824403842"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:37.782"><div begin="15.781" end="39.314" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="15.781" end="20.827" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="15.781" end="16.228">又</span><span begin="16.228" end="17.669">在</span><span begin="17.978" end="19.567">夜半时醒</span><span begin="19.567" end="20.827">来</span></p><p begin="21.883" end="26.953" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.883" end="22.313">对</span><span begin="22.313" end="23.673">着</span><span begin="24.093" end="25.592">天花板发</span><span begin="25.592" end="26.953">呆</span></p><p begin="27.842" end="34.058" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.842" end="28.761">想起</span><span begin="28.761" end="30.179">那时你还</span><span begin="30.179" end="31.013">在</span> <span begin="31.360" end="33.229">能钻进你的</span><span begin="33.229" end="34.058">怀</span></p><p begin="34.422" end="39.314" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.422" end="37.800">不至于现在一个人难</span><span begin="37.800" end="39.314">挨</span></p></div><div begin="40.075" end="1:03.861" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="40.075" end="45.132" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.075" end="40.601">不</span><span begin="40.601" end="41.951">该</span><span begin="42.236" end="43.875">回忆里徘</span><span begin="43.875" end="45.132">徊</span></p><p begin="46.043" end="51.634" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.043" end="46.558">陷</span><span begin="46.558" end="47.887">在</span><span begin="48.396" end="50.042">没你的期</span><span begin="50.042" end="51.634">待</span></p><p begin="51.877" end="58.506" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.877" end="54.535">人总是那麼的奇</span><span begin="54.535" end="55.512">怪</span> <span begin="55.639" end="56.092">失</span><span begin="56.092" end="56.716">去</span><span begin="56.716" end="57.209">才</span><span begin="57.209" end="57.445">明</span><span begin="57.445" end="58.506">白</span></p><p begin="58.654" end="1:03.861" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.654" end="59.153">不会</span><span begin="59.153" end="1:01.734">有人一直原地等</span><span begin="1:01.734" end="1:03.861">待</span></p></div><div begin="1:04.012" end="1:27.993" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:04.012" end="1:09.834" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.012" end="1:05.293">我知道</span><span begin="1:05.293" end="1:06.318">你</span><span begin="1:06.388" end="1:07.878">不会再回</span><span begin="1:07.878" end="1:09.834">来</span></p><p begin="1:10.071" end="1:15.190" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.071" end="1:11.346">我知道</span><span begin="1:11.346" end="1:12.335">你</span><span begin="1:12.441" end="1:13.951">也很难释</span><span begin="1:13.951" end="1:15.190">怀</span></p><p begin="1:15.383" end="1:22.742" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.383" end="1:15.760">别</span><span begin="1:15.760" end="1:16.650">说</span><span begin="1:16.650" end="1:17.260">你</span><span begin="1:17.317" end="1:18.958">从未爱过</span><span begin="1:18.958" end="1:19.898">我</span> <span begin="1:20.012" end="1:21.931">是习惯有我</span><span begin="1:21.931" end="1:22.742">在</span></p><p begin="1:22.983" end="1:27.993" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:22.983" end="1:23.415">别让</span><span begin="1:23.415" end="1:24.918">狠话再将</span><span begin="1:24.918" end="1:26.055">彼此伤</span><span begin="1:26.055" end="1:27.993">害</span></p></div><div begin="1:28.306" end="1:54.866" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:28.306" end="1:33.682" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.306" end="1:29.515">爱过的</span><span begin="1:29.515" end="1:30.609">你</span><span begin="1:30.609" end="1:32.201">不会再回</span><span begin="1:32.201" end="1:33.682">来</span></p><p begin="1:34.306" end="1:40.267" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.306" end="1:35.597">后来的</span><span begin="1:35.597" end="1:36.586">我</span><span begin="1:36.697" end="1:38.646">在眼泪中明</span><span begin="1:38.646" end="1:40.267